        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>诗集页面 - 三行诗合集</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    background: #cfcac0;\n    font-family: \"Noto Serif SC\", \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n  }\n  .sheet {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 6px;\n    max-width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .card {\n    background: #f2ede2;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    padding: 22px 18px;\n    min-height: 210px;\n    position: relative;\n    border-right: 1px solid #e2dcce;\n  }\n  .title {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-orientation: upright;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n    margin-right: 16px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    padding-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .body-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #333;\n    white-space: pre-line;\n  }\n  .body-text p {\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 14px;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #b9b2a4;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    opacity: 0.7;\n  }\n  .mark-slash {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: #888;\n    transform: rotate(-35deg);\n    margin-left: 4px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"sheet\">\n\n  <!-- Row 1 -->\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"title\">口红游戏</div>\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p>用吻，<br>在你苦苦练就的腹肌上，<br>下一盘棋。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"title\">讲解词</div>\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p>三千年后，<br>他们的屋子，<br>成为人类最后一个遗迹。</p>\n      <p>讲解员说：<br>这里的每把椅子，<br>都摸过他们两个人。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"title\">人类研习课</div>\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p>夜晚来临，<br>一群麻雀，<br>站在窗前，<br>认真笔记：<br>人类情侣的显性特征是——<br>屋子很大<br>但他们要贴在一起<br>睡<span class=\"mark-slash\"></span></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Row 2 -->\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"title\">站稳扶好</div>\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p>地铁指示标写：<br>站稳扶好<br>今晚，<br>我也打算这样搂[?]你。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"watermark\">durex</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"title\">镜子</div>\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p>17<br>21<br>57<br>69</p>\n      <p>早上我照镜子时突然有点害羞，<br>觉得它什么都看见了。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"watermark\">durex</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"title\">独一份的时尚</div>\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p>我这么一个人，<br>哪懂什么时尚，<br>留过你的发型，<br>吼过你的歌，<br>跳过你的舞，<br>穿过你的衣服。</p>\n      <p>我这么一个人，<br>为了躺尚的你，<br>婚纱裙醮，<br>学了几个时尚的姿势。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"watermark\">durex</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Row 3 -->\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"title\">我们身体的实时天气</div>\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p>雨，<br>一会儿落，<br>一会儿停。</p>\n      <p>伞，<br>一会儿撑，<br>一会儿合。</p>\n      <p>我，<br>一会儿想你，<br>一会儿又想你。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"title\">毕生宏愿</div>\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p>代替那名医生，<br>为你做一场全面体检。<br>还要在你的耳朵里，<br>植入一场爱我的突变。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"title\">象限游戏</div>\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p>我180°地躺，<br>你90°地坐，<br>搭一架，<br>只有一二象限的坐标系。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
